WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
Bad Boys trailer is coming out.

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:03.294
Right now.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:04.671
Right now? Right, right now?

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:05.839
Yeah, ri-right now.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:06.631
Right now!

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:08.133
Right now!
-Ch-check it out.

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.008
It's hot.

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.136
Marcus:
Come on Mike, slow down!

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.387
We are late!

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:15.140
My stomach, Mike. I need a ginger ale.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.100
(Screaming)

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:20.311
Get a ginger ale, and nothing else.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.439
Are those dogs fresh?

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:23.356
Put’ em in yesterday.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.734
Give me one. Put some relish on
that motherfucker.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:26.860
Thug:
Open the register!

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.153
Thug:
Stay right there!

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:30.739
Is that Skittles on the counter Marcus?

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:31.781
This ain’t mine Mike.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:32.323
Yes it is.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.074
Shut the fuck up!

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:34.033
Marcus, get in the car.

00:00:34.075 --> 00:00:35.452
He has a gun to my head!

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.745
You want to deal with him or you
want to deal with me?

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:39.080
Sorry sir, but I gotta go.

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.333
Call 911.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.418
Clerk:
Aren’t you the police?

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.047
Marcus:
Hey Reggie! Did you eat my snacks?

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:48.798
No, sir!

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.133
You ate my snacks didn’t you?

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.176
You need to get a job.

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:52.343
I’m a US Marine, sir.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:53.887
Well then you need to deploy.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:55.305
Daughter:
Dad, look.

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:59.434
News Anchor:
We now have evidence that the late
Capt. Conrad Howard of Miami PD 

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.312
News Anchor:
was working directly with drug cartels
...for years.

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:06.357
Captain Howard is being framed.

00:01:06.357 --> 00:01:06.983
Let's go!

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:09.527
What the hell?

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:11.488
He’s texting us from the other side.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:12.822
No he’s not, Marcus.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.575
If you’re seeing this, I’m probably dead.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:18.328
Fuck! Fuckers! Fuck ‘em all!

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:23.958
Conrad Howard:
I don’t how high up this shit goes,
but don’t trust anybody.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:26.586
You’re my bad boys, now clear my name.

00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:29.839
Armando:
You should be careful.

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:34.677
You’re being set up detectives.

00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:45.647
Judy Howard:
We got two suspects, Lowrey
and Burnett!

00:01:47.524 --> 00:01:48.650
They’re armed and dangerous!

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:52.070
Marcus:
In 5… 4….3…

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:55.156
No! Windshield wiper fluid is flammable!

00:01:55.156 --> 00:01:56.407
I ain’t no damn scientist!

00:01:58.576 --> 00:02:00.453
Y’all are some terrible fucking fugitives.

00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:13.299
I need nasty Mike! Bad Boy!

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.884
(Yelling)

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:16.594
I got this!

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.221
But you don’t though!

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:32.485
Are y’all stealing our clothes?

00:02:32.569 --> 00:02:34.445
Just because we black,
we stealing your shit?

00:02:34.612 --> 00:02:35.071
Marcus!

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:35.446
What?

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:36.322
Look at your shirt.

00:02:38.074 --> 00:02:40.243
Why don’t you sing us a little Reba song?

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:41.786
Oh come on, Reba.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.787
Sing your favorite.

00:02:42.912 --> 00:02:44.956
Uh...I'm a woman...

00:02:44.956 --> 00:02:46.499
I’m a strong black woman...

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:47.667
Yeah ‘cuz she’s not black.
-Yes.

00:02:47.876 --> 00:02:50.712
What you gonna do,
what you gonna…

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:52.463
That ain’t no Reba song.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:53.756
It’s from her mixtape.

